###Request
POST https://Testresources.virginatlantic.com/dev/checkinmicroservice/CheckIn HTTP/1.1

$[?(@.pnrLocator == 'UMNRPR')]

###Response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "travelPartyId": "UMNRPR-travel-party",
  "onlineCheckInStatus": {
    "available": false,
    "code": "UMNR",
    "title": "Airport check in required",
    "message": "Young travellers can’t check in online.",
    "advisoryText1": "We can't check you in online if you wish to enroll in the Delta Unaccompanied Minor program. This requires you to check in at the airport with an agent."
  }
}
